## 1. Verdict

I evaluated the **current `main` branch** of `amanpratap1999/UAT_poc`, with the scope restricted to **ServiceNow Incident Management only**. The current HEAD is `8817b9d2...` and includes the latest I16/I2 fixes and CI changes. [Current repository main branch](https://github.com/amanpratap1999/UAT_poc/tree/main?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

Under your evidence rules, code inspection is **I (inferred)** and repository reports are **D (documented)** unless I independently execute the behavior; there is no current-turn live ServiceNow execution available to me. 

