| ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------: |
| **Verified Score**                             |                                                                      **2.6 / 10** |
| **Claimed Ceiling**                            |                                                         **4.0 / 10 gate-limited** |
| Architectural capability before evidence/gates |                                                                         ~6.4 / 10 |
| Confidence                                     |                                                                           **Low** |
| Readiness                                      |                                                                     **Demo-ware** |
| Primary limiting factor                        | No independently repeatable, compliant Incident UAT benchmark with seeded defects |
